{"id":"3724ccc01fdd0b62","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-quadmin.md","title":"Irredundant sub-DNF existence","display":"thm-quadmin — Irredundant sub-DNF existence","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-quadmin","aliases":["27-thm-quadmin"],"display":"thm-quadmin — Irredundant sub-DNF existence","depends_on":["[[27-df-quadfunc]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§5.8","source_statement":"Local finite-deletion existence lemma; not the chapter minimization algorithm","source_printed_pages":"251–261","source_pdf_pages":"275–285","verification_status":"proved-in-note-source-context-checked","local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-quadmin"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-quadmin</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-quadmin — Irredundant sub-DNF existence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"923be44c9742df37\" href=\"?note=923be44c9742df37\" title=\"27-df-quadfunc\">27-df-quadfunc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.8"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Local finite-deletion existence lemma; not the chapter minimization algorithm"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"251–261"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"275–285"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note-source-context-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"923be44c9742df37\" href=\"?note=923be44c9742df37\" title=\"27-df-quadfunc\">27-df-quadfunc</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists E\\subseteq D\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\land\\forall T\\in E\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E\\setminus\\{T\\})\\neq\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E))\\land(D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\\Rightarrow E\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists E\\subseteq D\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\land\\forall T\\in E\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E\\setminus\\{T\\})\\neq\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E))\\land(D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\\Rightarrow E\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限次删去冗余项得到 E，且取子集保持二次项长度界。这是一般有限 DNF 的基本存在性推论，原书 §5.8 讨论更强的 quadratic irredundant/minimum 算法，不能把这里的删除过程当作最少项数算法。空 DNF 和含空项的 DNF 都覆盖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-quadfunc","status":"resolved","id":"923be44c9742df37","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-quadfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-quadfunc","status":"resolved","id":"923be44c9742df37","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n$；$\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n$ 和 $\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n$（see [[27-df-quadfunc]]）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists E\\subseteq D\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\land\\forall T\\in E\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E\\setminus\\{T\\})\\neq\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E))\\land(D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n\\Rightarrow E\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1507,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-528","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-quadmin|thm-quadmin — Irredundant sub-DNF existence]]"}],"outgoing":["923be44c9742df37"]}